Preserve the liuqin DP PHY vendor register tables and sequencing.

Converted from the whole-file replacement at commit 73e8071. Applied after
0008, this produces the exact same driver bytes as that replacement. Keep
the current HBR2-only limitation; this patch does not expand link support.

The register-table generator is in ../tools/dp-gen-vendor-tables.py. The
original private live capture is not a build input: the reviewed table
values are carried by this patch, together with the manual COM/PD_CTL fixes.

--- a/drivers/phy/qualcomm/phy-qcom-qmp-combo.c
+++ b/drivers/phy/qualcomm/phy-qcom-qmp-combo.c
@@ -3051,6 +3051,145 @@
