+	 * DP side taken from the live state of the vendor stack on this board
+	 * (Xiaomi Android 15, 5.10.209: HBR2 4-lane, 2560x1600@60, widebus).
+	 * The 4nm PHY uses the V6/N4 register layout: the V4/V5 offsets wrote
+	 * the right values into the wrong registers (only 5 of 33 writes ever
+	 * matched the live registers), so the DP PLL never locked and
+	 * qmp_v456_configure_dp_phy() timed out with -ETIMEDOUT.  The values
